ss to pass certain voting rights legislation,</li><li>recommends the development of a curriculum in public schools and universities regarding voting,</li><li>expresses appreciation for the U.S. Postal Service having issued a special Representative John R. Lewis stamp, and</li><li>invites Congress to allocate funds for public service announcements regarding elections.</li></ul>","updateDate":"2026-04-24T22:18:46Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"A resolution designating September 2025 as \"National Voting Rights Month\".","type":"sres","updateDate":"2026-09-23T15:30:52Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-23T15:30:52Z"}
